    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d123-a1-a40">

                <pb facs="0417" n="359" sameAs="frus:frus1866p3/pg359"/>

                <head ana="#head_untitled-missing-head-in-printed-volume">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi>,</placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1866-03-02"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >March</hi> 2, 1866.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Sir</hi>: Yours of the 28th has reached me. I am
                    obliged to you for the information you offer in regard to the close of the
                    administration of President Juarez</p>
                <p>My object in offering the resolution was to have a publication of all the
                    documents pertaining to the subject now in the hands of the Executive, and they
                    ought to be complete, for the information of Congress as well as the people.</p>
                <p>Your most obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>GREEN CLAY SMITH.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Joaquin Villalobos, New York</hi>.</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
